<title>MALAYSIA: CRICKET-ICC TROPHY SECOND ROUND RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ICC TROPHY SECOND ROUND RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of second round</p>
<p>matches in the International Cricket Council (ICC) Trophy</p>
<p>tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>Hong Kong v Netherlands - match abandoned - rain</p>
<p>Scores: Hong Kong 170 all out in 47.5 overs; Netherlands</p>
<p>16-0 in 5.2 overs</p>
<p>Canada v Scotland - match abandoned - rain</p>
<p>Scores: Canada 99-4 in 29.4 overs</p>
<p>Group F</p>
<p>Bangladesh v Ireland - match abandoned - rain</p>
<p>Scores: Bangladesh 129 all out in 49.1 overs; Ireland 24-0</p>
<p>in 6.4 overs</p>
<p>Denmark v Kenya - match abandoned - rain</p>
<p>Scores: Denmark 33-4 in 9.4 overs</p>
<p>    Standings	  Pl  W  L  NR  Pts</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p> Kenya		    2  1  0   1   3</p>
<p> Scotland		 2  1  0   1   3</p>
<p> Canada		   2  0  1   1   1</p>
<p> Denmark		  2  0  1   1   1</p>
<p>Group F</p>
<p> Bangladesh	     2  1  0   1   3</p>
<p> Ireland		  2  1  0   1   3</p>
<p> Hong Kong		2  0  1   1   1</p>
<p> Netherlands	    2  0  1   1   1</p>
<p>Next matches:</p>
<p>April 4</p>
<p>Group 3</p>
<p> Kenya	v Scotland</p>
<p> Denmark    v Canada</p>
<p>Group F</p>
<p>Bangladesh v Netherlands</p>
<p> Ireland    v Hong Kong</p>
</text>
